loadrt mikron_gearbox
addf mikron-gearbox servo-thread

net request-spindle-first-range mikron-gearbox.motor-slow
net request-spindle-second-range mikron-gearbox.motor-fast

net request-block1-backward mikron-gearbox.block-one-backward
net request-block1-middle mikron-gearbox.block-one-middle
net request-block1-forward mikron-gearbox.block-one-forward

net request-block2-backward mikron-gearbox.block-two-backward
net request-block2-middle mikron-gearbox.block-two-middle
net request-block2-forward mikron-gearbox.block-two-forward

net request-block3-backward mikron-gearbox.block-three-backward
net request-block3-middle mikron-gearbox.block-three-middle
net request-block3-forward mikron-gearbox.block-three-forward

net gear-changing mikron-gearbox.changing
net spindle-on mikron-gearbox.spindle-on spindle.0.on

net spindle-speed-in-abs spindle.0.speed-out-abs mikron-gearbox.spindle-speed-in-abs
net spindle-speed-out spindle.0.speed-in mikron-gearbox.spindle-speed-out
